    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's a symptom, but what if the symptom is the truth? like, what if the \"fix\" is just a way to prolong the suffering? everything is just so loud and demanding and i just want it to be quiet. i just want to be able to stop. i just want to finally rest without having to wake up and do it all over again.",
