      "content": "The desire for quiet and deep rest is a profoundly human need when everything feels overwhelmingly loud. It is important to separate the feeling of exhaustion from the reality of the situation; a difficult state does not mean there is no path forward. If the noise of life feels unbearable, talking to someone about finding ways to manage that overwhelming sensory input can offer immediate relief. Please allow a professional to help you find a path toward that quiet peace you are seeking.",
